# .NET Rules

## General
- .NET 8+ / C# 12+
- Nullable reference types enabled
- Use `async`/`await` for all I/O
- Follow Microsoft naming conventions (PascalCase methods, camelCase locals)

## Architecture
- Clean Architecture or Vertical Slices
- Dependency injection via built-in DI container
- Repository pattern for data access
- MediatR for CQRS if applicable

## ASP.NET Core
- Minimal APIs or Controllers (project preference)
- FluentValidation for request validation
- Strongly-typed configuration (`IOptions<T>`)
- Structured logging with Serilog

## Entity Framework Core
- Code-first migrations
- No raw SQL in controllers
- AsNoTracking for read-only queries
- Explicit includes (no lazy loading)

## Security
- Authentication via Keycloak OIDC (JwtBearer)
- Authorization policies (not role checks in controllers)
- Anti-forgery tokens for form submissions
- Health checks endpoint exposed

## Testing
- xUnit for test framework
- FluentAssertions for assertions
- Moq or NSubstitute for mocking
- Integration tests with WebApplicationFactory
